# Links lychee should not verify.
#
# The demo gifs are build artifacts: the tapes render them into dist/, which
# .gitignore excludes and `goreleaser release --clean` wipes. The markdown
# gallery deliberately keeps the repo-relative dist/ path as a placeholder,
# because `rendertapes -publish` rewrites exactly that string into the hosted
# Charm URL — removing the links would leave the publish pipeline with nothing
# to match on.
#
# .github/workflows/demos.yml runs that publish on merge to the default branch
# and opens a PR with the real URLs. Until it does, the paths point at files
# that only exist on a machine that has rendered them, so the link check has
# to skip them.
dist/.*\.gif$
